ufetch-plus.
============
a small system information utility for Linux systems.  

~ $ ufetch 
                     
        /\          sakaki@arch(1000)
       /^^\         OS:        Arch Linux
      /\   \        KERNEL:    Linux 7.1.5-arch1-2
     /  __  \       UPTIME:    2:08
    /  (  )  \      PACKAGES:  499
   / __|  |__\\     SHELL:     bash
  ///        \\\    CPU:       Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-4590 CPU @ 3.30GHz (4)
                    RAM:       3870 MiB / 15939 MiB 
                    SWAP:      0 MiB / 8165 MiB

~ $
